            "processedContentHtml": "\n                  <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <!-- Conceito -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"info\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#047857]\"></i>\n                          O Conceito (Sujeito Obrigatório)\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Em inglês, <b>toda frase deve ter um sujeito explícito</b> (um pronome ou nome). Ao contrário do português, o inglês não aceita sujeito oculto. Nunca omita o sujeito.\n                      </p>\n                      <div class=\"p-2.5 bg-red-50 text-red-700 font-mono text-xs rounded border border-red-100\">\n                        ❌ Is ready. (Errado) | ✅ He is ready. (Certo)\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Tabela -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"table\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#047857]\"></i>\n                          Tabela Essencial dos Pronomes\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                        <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse\">\n                          <thead>\n                            <tr class=\"bg-emerald-50 border-b border-emerald-100 text-[#047857] font-bold\">\n                              <th class=\"p-2\">Pronome (Inglês)</th>\n                              <th class=\"p-2\">Significado (Português)</th>\n                              <th class=\"p-2\">Exemplo Prático</th>\n                            </tr>\n                          </thead>\n                          <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-700\">\n                            <tr><td class=\"p-2 font-bold text-slate-900\">I</td><td class=\"p-2\">Eu (sempre em maiúscula)</td><td class=\"p-2\">I am here.</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td class=\"p-2 font-bold text-slate-900\">YOU</td><td class=\"p-2\">Você / Vocês</td><td class=\"p-2\">You are smart.</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td class=\"p-2 font-bold text-slate-900\">HE</td><td class=\"p-2\">Ele (masculino singular)</td><td class=\"p-2\">He is the hero.</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td class=\"p-2 font-bold text-slate-900\">SHE</td><td class=\"p-2\">Ela (feminino singular)</td><td class=\"p-2\">She is the witch.</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td class=\"p-2 font-bold text-slate-900\">IT</td><td class=\"p-2\">Ele / Ela (neutro/coisas/animais)</td><td class=\"p-2\">It is the door.</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td class=\"p-2 font-bold text-slate-900\">WE</td><td class=\"p-2\">Nós (narrador + outros)</td><td class=\"p-2\">We are friends.</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td class=\"p-2 font-bold text-slate-900\">THEY</td><td class=\"p-2\">Eles / Elas (plural de tudo)</td><td class=\"p-2\">They run fast.</td></tr>\n                          </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Armadilhas -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"help-circle\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#d97706]\"></i>\n                          Armadilhas Críticas da Audição\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                        <li><b>O \"It\" de Identidade Oculta:</b> Usado para pessoas cuja identidade é desconhecida. Ex: <i>\"Who is it?\"</i> (Quem bate à porta?) ➔ <i>\"It's me!\"</i> (Sou eu!).</li>\n                        <li><b>Pluralidade do \"They\":</b> Serve para o plural de qualquer coisa (pessoas, animais, livros, portas). Ex: <i>\"The books are on the table. They are big.\"</i></li>\n                      </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Workbook -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-amber-200\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#b45309] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"edit-3\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n                          Prática de Workbook (Teste Rápido)\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800\">\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">1. The robot is here. It is ready.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">O pronome <b>It</b> substitui: ______________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">2. The phone is ringing. It's your boss.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">Por que usamos <b>It</b> aqui? ______________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">3. My sister and I are ready. We go now.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">O pronome <b>We</b> substitui: ______________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                ",
