            "goldenTip": "Não decore tabelas! Foque na sonoridade das contrações (I'm, He's, We're, They're) no player.",
            "rawScript": "",
            "processedContentHtml": "\n                  <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <!-- Conceito -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"info\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#047857]\"></i>\n                          O Conceito (Ser ou Estar)\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                        O Verbo <b>TO BE</b> é o único em inglês que acumula duas funções: <b>SER</b> (identidade, profissão) ou <b>ESTAR</b> (local, estado de espírito). O contexto determina qual sentido usar.\n                      </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- As 3 Formas Básicas -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"grid\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#047857]\"></i>\n                          As 3 Formas Básicas & Contrações\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3\">\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-red-50/50 rounded-xl border border-red-200\">\n                          <span class=\"font-black text-red-700 block text-lg\">AM</span>\n                          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-600\">Exclusivo do pronome <b>I</b>.<br/>Contração: <b>I'm</b></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-pink-50/50 rounded-xl border border-pink-200\">\n                          <span class=\"font-black text-pink-700 block text-lg\">IS</span>\n                          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-600\">Terceira Pessoa (He, She, It).<br/>Contrações: <b>He's / She's / It's</b></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/50 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\">\n                          <span class=\"font-black text-emerald-700 block text-lg\">ARE</span>\n                          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-600\">Pronomes Plurais (You, We, They).<br/>Contrações: <b>You're / We're / They're</b></span>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Exemplos -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"repeat\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#047857]\"></i>\n                          SER vs. ESTAR na Prática\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                        <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-700 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider\">SER (Identidade)</h4>\n                          <div class=\"p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1\">\n                            <p class=\"font-bold text-slate-800\">I'm a designer. <span class=\"text-slate-500 font-medium\">(Eu sou designer)</span></p>\n                            <p class=\"font-bold text-slate-800\">She's smart. <span class=\"text-slate-500 font-medium\">(Ela é inteligente)</span></p>\n                            <p class=\"font-bold text-slate-800\">They're colleagues. <span class=\"text-slate-500 font-medium\">(Eles são colegas)</span></p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n                          <h4 class=\"font-bold text-blue-700 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider\">ESTAR (Local/Estado)</h4>\n                          <div class=\"p-2.5 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl text-xs space-y-1\">\n                            <p class=\"font-bold text-slate-800\">I'm in the office. <span class=\"text-slate-500 font-medium\">(Eu estou no escritório)</span></p>\n                            <p class=\"font-bold text-slate-800\">He's tired. <span class=\"text-slate-500 font-medium\">(Ele está cansado)</span></p>\n                            <p class=\"font-bold text-slate-800\">The reports are ready. <span class=\"text-slate-500 font-medium\">(Os relatórios estão prontos)</span></p>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Workbook -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-amber-200\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#b45309] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"edit-3\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n                          Prática de Workbook (Escreva a Forma Completa & Tradução)\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800\">\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">1. It's a strange noise.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">Forma Completa: ________________ | Tradução: ________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">2. They're not home.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">Forma Completa: ________________ | Tradução: ________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">3. We're late for the meeting.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">Forma Completa: ________________ | Tradução: ________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">4. He's a good pilot.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">Forma Completa: ________________ | Tradução: ________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                ",
