            "processedContentHtml": "\n                  <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                    <!-- Concept -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"info\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#047857]\"></i>\n                          O Conceito (A Regra do NOT)\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Para negar qualquer afirmação com o Verbo To Be, basta adicionar a palavra <b>NOT</b> imediatamente após o verbo conjugado (am, is, are).\n                      </p>\n                      <div class=\"p-2.5 bg-emerald-50 text-[#047857] font-mono text-xs rounded border border-emerald-100\">\n                        Estrutura: SUJEITO + TO BE + NOT + COMPLEMENTO\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Tabela Negativa -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"table\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#047857]\"></i>\n                          Tabela de Negação & Contrações\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                        <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs border-collapse\">\n                          <thead>\n                            <tr class=\"bg-emerald-50 border-b border-emerald-100 text-[#047857] font-bold\">\n                              <th class=\"p-2\">Sujeito</th>\n                              <th class=\"p-2\">Forma Completa</th>\n                              <th class=\"p-2\">Contração Comum</th>\n                              <th class=\"p-2\">Tradução Real</th>\n                            </tr>\n                          </thead>\n                          <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-700\">\n                            <tr><td class=\"p-2 font-bold\">I</td><td class=\"p-2\">I am not</td><td class=\"p-2 font-bold text-blue-600\">I'm not</td><td class=\"p-2\">Eu não sou / Eu não estou</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td class=\"p-2 font-bold\">HE / SHE / IT</td><td class=\"p-2\">He is not</td><td class=\"p-2 font-bold text-pink-600\">He isn't / She isn't / It isn't</td><td class=\"p-2\">Ele/Ela não é ou não está</td></tr>\n                            <tr><td class=\"p-2 font-bold\">YOU / WE / THEY</td><td class=\"p-2\">You are not</td><td class=\"p-2 font-bold text-emerald-600\">You aren't / We aren't / They aren't</td><td class=\"p-2\">Você/Nós/Eles não são ou não estão</td></tr>\n                          </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Foco -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#EAE5DC] shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-[#F0EBE1]\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0A192F] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"message-square\" class=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#d97706]\"></i>\n                          Foco nas Contrações Faladas\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                        Nas histórias e na fala real, você ouvirá **ISN'T** e **AREN'T** na imensa maioria das frases negativas. Lembre-se de que a primeira pessoa **I** não tem contração \"amn't\", usando-se apenas **I'm not**.\n                      </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Workbook -->\n                    <div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-xs space-y-3\">\n                      <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-amber-200\">\n                        <span class=\"font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#b45309] flex items-center gap-2\">\n                          <i data-lucide=\"edit-3\" class=\"w-4 h-4\"></i>\n                          Prática de Workbook (Traduza e indique a Forma Completa)\n                        </span>\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800\">\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">1. The mission isn't impossible.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">Forma Completa: ________________ | Tradução: ________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">2. They aren't telling the truth.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">Forma Completa: ________________ | Tradução: ________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">3. I'm not the enemy.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">Forma Completa: ________________ | Tradução: ________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-amber-100\">\n                          <p class=\"font-bold\">4. She isn't a part of this.</p>\n                          <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-1\">Forma Completa: ________________ | Tradução: ________________</p>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                ",
